AETHER AR
An unofficial mixed-reality mod, by AETHER.

AETHER AR is a modified version of BT3-Recomp
  https://github.com/z3xox/BT3-Recomp (z3xox, GPL-3.0)
based on commit e22a34beb564e2d0f32bd60b02f0a95d9645ddcc (see package/mod/BASE).

Modified by AETHER since 20 October 2026.
Version 1.0.13, 4 November 2026

Every change is in package/mod/aether-ar.patch, a git diff against that
commit. The changes of each version are listed in package/README.md and in
the notes of each release. The modified work is licensed under the GNU General
Public License, version 3 (LICENSE), like BT3-Recomp.

Parts the build uses (Setup fetches them; they are not included here):
- BT3-Recomp, by z3xox, GPL-3.0, built on PS2Recomp (ran-j, GPL-3.0). Its
  own third-party parts (paraLLEl-GS, Arntzen Software, LGPL-3.0-or-later;
  NTSC-U AFS file lists, ViveTheModder, Apache-2.0) are listed in its README
  and THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md.
- The OpenXR loader from OpenXR-SDK release-1.0.34, The Khronos Group,
  Apache-2.0 (https://github.com/KhronosGroup/OpenXR-SDK), linked into the
  build.

No game content: no code, graphics, sound or other files of Dragon Ball Z:
Budokai Tenkaichi 3 are included. Each player builds the game on their own
PC from their own disc. Do not share disc images or built programs.

